            ('| `event` | `string` | One of the events below.'),
            ('Closed vocabulary; additions are additive contract changes. |'),
            ('| `maintenance_id` | `int` | The window this event concerns: the `control_seq` of '
             'the entry that opened it.'),
            ('Canonical decimal integer in `1 .. 2^53 - 1`. |'),
