             'during boot recovery in a later boot. |'),
            ('| All others | Equal.'),
            ('Each is emitted by the boot running the window it describes. |'),
            ('A consumer MUST therefore compare the two values rather than infer the '
             'relationship from the event name.'),
            ('Conflating the fields would make a recovery event describe a window entered in '
