            ('An `ingress_degraded` fault with `detail` `liveness_authority_failed` says that '
             'the runtime liveness authority could not be installed, so the device was left '
             'without runtime supervision.'),
            ('It is not a measure of how long the device ran unsupervised, and it neither opens '
             'nor closes any liveness window.'),
            ('Its absence is not evidence that the device is supervised.'),
            ("The interlock codes and `command_rejected` keep v1's meaning."),
            ('The fault object has no field for the time of the condition.'),
            ('If one is ever needed, it is a separately named field with its own boot '
