            ('`device_uptime_ms` is never overloaded with it.'),
        ),
        '## Reading Envelope at `v` 2': (
            ('| Field | Type | Notes |'),
            ("| `v` | `int` | The envelope's version:"),
            ('`1` or `2`. |'),
            ('| `liveness_nonce` | `string \\| null` | Required at `v` `2` and forbidden at `v` '
             '`1`.'),
            ('Exactly 32 characters, each one of `0`-`9` or `a`-`f`: the `nonce` of the runtime '
